      <div><h2 id="assembly-versions-heading">The Maize B73 Representative Reference Genome</h2></div>
      <p>The maize B73 reference genome has been revised across five generations since its initial BAC-by-BAC release in 2009. The maize nomenclature committee standards accommodate multiple <i>Zea</i> species, accessions, and versions \([<a href="https://documents.maizegdb.org/nomenclature/maize_assembly_nomenclature_2021.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Nomenclature Standards PDF</a>]\).</p>
    </div>

