  <!-- SECTION 2: ASSEMBLY DETAILS & STATUS -->
  <section id="assembly-details" aria-labelledby="assembly-details-heading">
    <div class="mgdb-section-heading">
      <div><h2 id="assembly-details-heading">Assembly Details &amp; Status</h2></div>
      <p>Detailed structural composition, contig statistics, and sequencing methodology across each reference assembly release.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-panel">
    <div class="assembly-cards-grid">
      <!-- V5 Card -->
      <article class="assembly-detail-card is-current-card">
        <div class="assembly-detail-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="assembly-detail-title">Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0 <span class="assembly-detail-version">\(v5\)</span></h3>
            <span class="assembly-detail-sub">Current Gold-Standard Representative Reference</span>
          </div>
          <span class="assembly-badge assembly-badge-active">Active Standard</span>
        </div>
        <div class="assembly-detail-metrics">
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2,133 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Total Assembled</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">25.6 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Contig N50</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">10</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Pseudomolecules</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">40</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Unplaced Contigs</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="assembly-detail-desc">De novo assembly constructed from PacBio Sequel long-read sequencing technology. Scaffolds validated and anchored by BioNano optical mapping and genetic linkage maps. Annotated with <code>Zm00001eb.1</code> containing sequentially numbered gene models.</p>
        <div class="assembly-detail-links">
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="/genome/assembly/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0">Assembly Profile</a>
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-NAM-5.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download Directory</a>
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/bioproject/PRJEB32225" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NCBI BioProject &#8599;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- V4 Card -->
      <article class="assembly-detail-card">
        <div class="assembly-detail-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="assembly-detail-title">Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0 <span class="assembly-detail-version">\(v4\)</span></h3>
            <span class="assembly-detail-sub">PacBio Single-Molecule Real-Time Assembly</span>
          </div>
          <span class="assembly-badge">v4 Reference</span>
        </div>
        <div class="assembly-detail-metrics">
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2,134 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Total Assembled</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">1.18 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Contig N50</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">10</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Pseudomolecules</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">625</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Unplaced Scaffolds</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="assembly-detail-desc">Complete de novo assembly generated using PacBio single-molecule technology on high-molecular-weight DNA extracted from a descendant of the accession used for v1&ndash;v3 assemblies \(PI 677128\). Annotated with Filtered Gene Set <code>Zm00001d.2</code>.</p>
        <div class="assembly-detail-links">
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="/genome/assembly/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0">Assembly Profile</a>
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="https://download.maizegdb.org/Zm-B73-REFERENCE-GRAMENE-4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download Directory</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- V3 Card -->
      <article class="assembly-detail-card">
        <div class="assembly-detail-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="assembly-detail-title">B73 RefGen_v3 <span class="assembly-detail-version">\(v3\)</span></h3>
            <span class="assembly-detail-sub">BAC Framework with WGS Gap Closure</span>
          </div>
          <span class="assembly-badge">v3 Legacy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="assembly-detail-metrics">
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2,066 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Total Assembled</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">10</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Pseudomolecules</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">213</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">New Gene Models</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">251</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Improved Models</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="assembly-detail-desc">Captured missing gene space in v2 using whole-genome shotgun \(WGS\) sequence reads. Introduced 213 new gene models, improved 251 gene models, and merged 10 models. Annotated with <code>5b+</code> and MAKER-P gene sets.</p>
        <div class="assembly-detail-links">
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="/genome/assembly/B73%20RefGen_v3">Assembly Profile</a>
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="https://download.maizegdb.org/B73_RefGen_v3/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Download Directory</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- V2 & V1 Card -->
      <article class="assembly-detail-card">
        <div class="assembly-detail-header">
          <div>
            <h3 class="assembly-detail-title">B73 RefGen_v2 &amp; RefGen_v1</h3>
            <span class="assembly-detail-sub">Foundational BAC Physical Map Assemblies</span>
          </div>
          <span class="assembly-badge">Historic BAC</span>
        </div>
        <div class="assembly-detail-metrics">
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2,048 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">v1 Assembly</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2,066 Mb</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">v2 Assembly</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">10</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Chromosomes</span></div>
          <div class="assembly-metric-item"><span class="assembly-metric-value">2009</span><span class="assembly-metric-label">Initial Release</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="assembly-detail-desc">RefGen_v1 was the first complete sequencing of the maize B73 genome using BAC-by-BAC Sanger sequencing \(Schnable et al. 2009\). RefGen_v2 improved the ordering and orientation of intra-BAC contigs using the minimum tiling path \(MTP\).</p>
        <div class="assembly-detail-links">
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="/genome/assembly/B73%20RefGen_v2">RefGen_v2 Profile</a>
          <a class="mgdb-button mgdb-button-secondary mgdb-button-sm" href="/genome/assembly/B73%20RefGen_v1">RefGen_v1 Profile</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 3: GENE MODELS & NOMENCLATURE -->
