    </div>

    <div class="mgdb-panel">
    <div class="assembly-notice-box">
      <strong>Important Annotation Notice&#58;</strong>
      <p>The B73 v5 and NAM founders genome assemblies were initially released with a preliminary annotation \(<code>Zm00001e.1</code>\). The official annotation \(<code>Zm00001eb.1</code>\) features refined gene models and sequentially numbered identifiers across chromosomes. Use the official <code>Zm00001eb.1</code> gene models for current analyses. Cross-references between preliminary, v4, and v3 models are available below.</p>
