      <!-- 8: Coe & Schaeffer 2005 -->
      <article class="reference-result-card">
        <div class="reference-result-meta">
          <span>2005</span><span>Review</span><span>Maydica</span><span>MaizeGDB Reference</span>
        </div>
        <h3><a href="/reference/9017907">Genetic, physical maps, and database resources for maize</a></h3>
        <p class="reference-result-authors">Coe E, Schaeffer ML.</p>
        <p class="reference-result-citation">Maydica &bull; 50 &bull; 285-303</p>
        <p class="reference-result-abstract">Comprehensive documentation of the materials, BAC clone resources, high-molecular-weight DNA preparations, IBM mapping population ancestry, and contig frameworks that underpinned the maize genome sequencing initiative.</p>
        <div class="reference-result-links">
          <a href="/reference/9017907">MaizeGDB Record &#8599;</a>
          <a href="/docs/B73materials.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PDF Paper &#8599;</a>
